OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of student who took own
OL,4,Alife after grading error reach
OL,5,Asettlement with university
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of a student who took his
OL,8,Fown life after being wrongly told he
OL,9,Fhad failed his degree have agreed a
OL,10,Fsettlement with Glasgow University.
OL,12,FEthan Brown, 23, from Coatbridge, North
OL,13,FLanarkshire, should have been awarded a
OL,14,F2:1 degree but was incorrectly told he
OL,15,Fhad not passed his course.
OL,17,FHe was found dead in his family home on
OL,18,F13 December 2024 - the day he had been
OL,19,Fdue to graduate from the University of
OL,20,FGlasgow with an honours degree in
OL,21,Fgeography.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
